{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-56362-r4513716","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Seitan Burger","sourcePageId":56362,"sourceRevision":"4513716","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-19T01:10:48Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Seitan%20Burger&oldid=4513716","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T14:16:00.540Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using bread crumb","Category:Recipes using gluten","Category:Recipes using seitan","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegan recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"237e1edf942bde86be51e5157139fb2b826a35c0eebc738be164cc39f989e4ca","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Vegetarian recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Vegan cuisine|Vegan cuisine]]\n\n'''Seitan burgers''' have a consistency similar to that of [[w:fillet|fillet]] and are easy to cover with breading. For the breading, the usual spices for meat can be used.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 1¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] water\n* [[Cookbook:Soy_sauce|Soy sauce]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Gluten|gluten]] flour (see [[Cookbook:Seitan|seitan]] for how to gain gluten from wheat flour)\n* Salt\n* Spices (e.g. [[Cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]], optional)\n* [[Cookbook:Onion|Onions]] (optional), [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n\n=== Breading (optional) ===\n\n* [[Cookbook:Breadcrumbs|Breadcrumbs]]\n* Salt\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n* [[Cookbook:cumin|Cumin]]\n* [[Cookbook:oregano|Oregano]]\n* [[Cookbook:Savory|Savory]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine water and soy sauce.\n# Combine gluten, salt, and spices.\n# Combine the water and gluten mixtures. [[Cookbook:Kneading|Knead]] until smooth.\n# If using, knead in chopped onions.\n# Shape the seitan dough into patties.\n# Combine all the ingredients for the breading, and use it to coat the patties on all sides.\n# [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] the patties in an oiled pan. Don't use too much oil but enough to let the breading pick up some oil on both sides.\n\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using seitan]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using gluten]]\n\n[[de:Kochbuch/ Seitan-Bratling]]\n[[he:ספר המתכונים הטבעוני/סייטן מהיר הכנה]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Seitan Burger","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1¼ cup water","sourceText":"1¼ cup water","amountText":"1¼ cup water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Soy sauce","sourceText":"Soy sauce","amountText":"Soy sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 cup gluten flour (see seitan for how to gain gluten from wheat flour)","sourceText":"1 cup gluten flour (see seitan for how to gain gluten from wheat flour)","amountText":"1 cup gluten flour (see seitan for how to gain gluten from wheat flour)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Spices (e.g. garlic powder, optional)","sourceText":"Spi